    <string name="reduce_splash_screen">Reduce unnecessary splash screens</string>
    <string name="reduce_splash_screen_tips">Reduces splash screens shown when entering app sub-processes caused by the \"Force show splash screen\" list, e.g. WeChat video moments, Alipay mini-programs.</string>
    <string name="force_enable_splash_screen">Force enable splash screen</string>
    <string name="force_enable_splash_screen_tips">If the module appears activated but does not work, try enabling this option.\nIf the module works normally, do \"not\" enable it.\nPossible side effects:\n1. Splash screens may appear in scenarios where they are not needed.\n2. App-defined Splash Screen background images may fail to display.</string>
    <string name="hot_start_compatible">Apply splash screen to hot starts</string>
    <string name="hot_start_compatible_tips">This option must be enabled together with \"Force enable splash screen\". Note: it requires checking \"System Framework\" in LSPosed manager scope and rebooting the device.</string>
    <string name="disable_splash_screen">Disable Splash Screen completely</string>
    <string name="disable_splash_screen_tips">With this option enabled, all other module settings become useless, so there is no need to check \"SystemUI\" in scope. Note: it requires checking \"System Framework\" in LSPosed manager scope and rebooting the device.</string>

